                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "097999af-8c0c-3863-8c11-947acb33c795",
                        "entry_id": "428a963e-42e1-3f1a-886d-4a85f5564ff9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "insincerity, hypocrisy"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8974ff30-2e0e-4b75-8264-3b56f6a72b0a",
                                "sense_id": "097999af-8c0c-3863-8c11-947acb33c795",
                                "text": "— Не ста́влю я вам в вину́ ва́шу неи́скренность, — вздохну́л Ильи́н. — Э́то я так, к сло́ву пришло́сь… Ва́ша неи́скренность и есте́ственна и в поря́дке веще́й. Е́сли бы все лю́ди сговори́лись и ста́ли вдруг и́скренни, то всё бы у них пошло́ к чё́рту пра́хом.",
                                "translation": "\"I don't blame you for your insincerity,\" sighed Ilyin. \"I did not mean that when I spoke of it. . . . Your insincerity is natural and in the order of things. If people agreed together and suddenly became sincere, everything would go to the devil.\"",
                                "english": "\"I don't blame you for your insincerity,\" sighed Ilyin. \"I did not mean that when I spoke of it. . . . Your insincerity is natural and in the order of things. If people agreed together and suddenly became sincere, everything would go to the devil.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
